  "title": "Qt: Update DisplayFilterCombo on theme change for all OSes",
  "description": "QEvent::ApplicationPaletteChange is sent to top-level windows, which\npropagate QEvent:PaletteChange to children, but not to children that\nuse style sheets. We have child widgets that use style sheets but\nvary appearance based on the application palette (generally whether\nit's considered Light or Dark.)\n\nFor DisplayFilterCombo, the shading of the downward arrow varies\non light and dark mode for every OS, not just macOS, so it needs to\nbe sent in all cases.",
